+ *
+ * @author Ilayaperumal Gopinathan
+ * @since 2.0.0
+ * @see <a href=
+ * "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/rate-limits/#rate-limits-in-headers">Rate
+ * limits in headers</a>
